# What must not reach the build context.
#
# The first two entries are the ones that matter: a .git directory in a build
# context is every secret anybody ever committed and then removed, and
# node_modules is both enormous and platform-specific -- the image installs its
# own from the lockfile.
.git
web/node_modules

# Build outputs. The image builds its own; copying a host build in would
# produce an image whose binary nobody can reproduce.
holzkube-managerd
dist
web/dist
internal/httpapi/dist

# Anything an operator might have left in a checkout.
*.tar.gz
*.pem
*.key
.planning
